      "html": "<div style=\"font-size:1.25cqw;letter-spacing:0.4em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C39A38;font-weight:600\">Next</div>\n  <h2 style=\"margin:2.2917cqw 0 0;font-family:var(--deck-display),system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:6.875cqw;line-height:1.0;letter-spacing:-0.03em;color:#FAF7F0\">Lesson 2<br>Word of God</h2>\n  <div style=\"height:0.2083cqw;background:#C39A38;width:10.4167cqw;margin:2.7083cqw 0 0\"></div>\n  <p style=\"margin:2.2917cqw 0 0;font-size:2.8125cqw;line-height:1.35;color:#E7DFCE;max-width:62.5cqw;text-wrap:pretty;font-weight:500\">Making the Bible your standard for life</p>\n  <div style=\"margin-top:6.25cqw;display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;font-size:1.25cqw;letter-spacing:0.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C39A38\">\n    <div>Acts 242 Church of Christ · <a href=\"https://www.acts242churchofchrist.com\">acts242churchofchrist.com</a></div>\n    <div>Acts 2:42</div>\n  </div>"
