      "html": "<div style=\"font-size:1.3542cqw;letter-spacing:0.42em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C39A38;font-weight:600\">Lesson Two</div>\n  <h1 style=\"margin:2.2917cqw 0 0;font-family:var(--deck-display),system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:10.2083cqw;line-height:0.94;letter-spacing:-0.03em;color:#FAF7F0\">WORD OF<br>GOD</h1>\n  <div style=\"height:0.2083cqw;background:#C39A38;width:11.4583cqw;margin:2.9167cqw 0 0\"></div>\n  <p style=\"margin:2.2917cqw 0 0;font-size:2.8125cqw;line-height:1.35;color:#E7DFCE;max-width:61.4583cqw;text-wrap:pretty;font-weight:500\">Making the Bible Your Standard for Life</p>\n  <div style=\"margin-top:6.7708cqw;display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;font-size:1.25cqw;letter-spacing:0.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C39A38\">\n    <div>Acts 242 Foundation Guide · Edition 1 · 2026</div>\n    <div>Lesson 2 of 7</div>\n  </div>"
