      "html": "<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:1.5625cqw\">\n    <div style=\"font-size:1.25cqw;letter-spacing:0.34em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C39A38;font-weight:600\">Reflect</div>\n    <h2 style=\"margin:0;font-family:var(--deck-display),system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:3.8542cqw;line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-0.015em;color:#123F72\">Answer Honestly</h2>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"height:0.2083cqw;background:#C39A38;width:6.875cqw;margin:1.7708cqw 0 0\"></div>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.5625cqw;margin-top:2.5cqw\">\n    <div style=\"font-size:3.4375cqw;line-height:1.22;font-weight:600;color:#23201C;text-wrap:pretty\">What has been my standard in life?</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:3.4375cqw;line-height:1.22;font-weight:600;color:#23201C;text-wrap:pretty\">Do I follow God’s Word or my own opinions?</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:3.4375cqw;line-height:1.22;font-weight:600;color:#23201C;text-wrap:pretty\">Am I willing to let the Bible correct me?</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:3.4375cqw;line-height:1.22;font-weight:600;color:#23201C;text-wrap:pretty\">What is one thing I have believed that I have never checked in Scripture?</div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"position:absolute;left:5cqw;right:5.4167cqw;bottom:2.3958cqw;display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;padding-top:1.3542cqw;border-top:0.1042cqw solid rgba(195,154,56,0.45)\">\n    <div style=\"font-size:1.25cqw;letter-spacing:0.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C39A38;font-weight:600\">Lesson 02 · Word of God</div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:1.5625cqw\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:1.25cqw;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C39A38\">Book p. 29</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:1.3542cqw;font-family:var(--deck-display),system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:800;color:#123F72\">22</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>"
