      "html": "<div style=\"font-size:1.25cqw;letter-spacing:0.34em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C39A38;font-weight:600\">Main Question</div>\n  <div style=\"height:0.2083cqw;background:#C39A38;width:6.875cqw;margin:1.5625cqw 0 0\"></div>\n  <h2 style=\"margin:3.9583cqw 0 0;font-family:var(--deck-display),system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:6.4583cqw;line-height:1.06;letter-spacing:-0.03em;color:#03194C;max-width:79.1667cqw;text-wrap:pretty\">Where are you right now — in the darkness, or in the light?</h2>\n  <div style=\"position:absolute;left:5cqw;right:5.4167cqw;bottom:2.3958cqw;display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;padding-top:1.3542cqw;border-top:0.1042cqw solid rgba(195,154,56,0.45)\">\n    <div style=\"font-size:1.25cqw;letter-spacing:0.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C39A38;font-weight:600\">Lesson 05 · Light and Darkness</div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:1.5625cqw\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:1.25cqw;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C39A38\">Book p. 66</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:1.3542cqw;font-family:var(--deck-display),system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:800;color:#03194C\">03</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>"
