      "html": "<div style=\"font-size:1.25cqw;letter-spacing:0.34em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C39A38;font-weight:600\">Your Timeline</div>\n  <h2 style=\"margin:1.25cqw 0 0;font-family:var(--deck-display),system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:4.2708cqw;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#03194C\">Before we open the Bible</h2>\n  <p style=\"margin:1.7708cqw 0 0;font-size:2.9167cqw;line-height:1.28;font-weight:600;color:#23201C\">What are your spiritual highlights?</p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0.8333cqw 0 0;font-size:2.2917cqw;line-height:1.4;color:#4A443B;max-width:77.0833cqw;text-wrap:pretty;font-weight:500\">Mark the moments that mattered — when you first heard about God, when you started asking questions, when something changed. Write the event above the line and roughly when it happened below it.</p>\n  \n  <div style=\"margin-top:2.9167cqw\">\n    <div style=\"font-size:1.25cqw;letter-spacing:0.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C39A38;font-weight:600\">Event</div>\n    <div style=\"height:6.25cqw\"></div>\n    <div style=\"position:relative;height:0.1563cqw;background:#03194C\"></div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:0\">\n      <div style=\"width:0.1563cqw;height:1.3542cqw;background:#03194C\"></div>\n      <div style=\"width:0.1563cqw;height:1.3542cqw;background:#03194C\"></div>\n      <div style=\"width:0.1563cqw;height:1.3542cqw;background:#03194C\"></div>\n      <div style=\"width:0.1563cqw;height:1.3542cqw;background:#03194C\"></div>\n      <div style=\"width:0.1563cqw;height:1.3542cqw;background:#03194C\"></div>\n      <div style=\"width:0.1563cqw;height:1.3542cqw;background:#03194C\"></div>\n      <div style=\"width:0.1563cqw;height:1.3542cqw;background:#03194C\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"height:3.75cqw\"></div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:1.25cqw;letter-spacing:0.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C39A38;font-weight:600\">When</div>\n  </div>\n  \n  <div style=\"position:absolute;left:5cqw;right:5.4167cqw;bottom:2.3958cqw;display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;padding-top:1.3542cqw;border-top:0.1042cqw solid rgba(195,154,56,0.45)\">\n    <div style=\"font-size:1.25cqw;letter-spacing:0.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C39A38;font-weight:600\">Lesson 05 · Light and Darkness</div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:1.5625cqw\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:1.25cqw;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C39A38\">Book p. 67</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:1.3542cqw;font-family:var(--deck-display),system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:800;color:#03194C\">05</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>"
