      "html": "<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:1.5625cqw\">\n    <div style=\"font-size:1.25cqw;letter-spacing:0.34em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C39A38;font-weight:600\">Ask</div>\n    <h2 style=\"margin:0;font-family:var(--deck-display),system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:3.4375cqw;line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-0.015em;color:#03194C\">Three Questions</h2>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"height:0.2083cqw;background:#C39A38;width:6.875cqw;margin:1.875cqw 0 0\"></div>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2.2917cqw;margin-top:3.3333cqw\">\n    <div style=\"font-size:3.9583cqw;line-height:1.2;font-weight:600;color:#03194C;text-wrap:pretty\">When do you believe you were saved?</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:3.9583cqw;line-height:1.2;font-weight:600;color:#03194C;text-wrap:pretty\">When did you receive the Holy Spirit?</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:3.9583cqw;line-height:1.2;font-weight:600;color:#03194C;text-wrap:pretty\">When did you receive the forgiveness of sin?</div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"position:absolute;left:5cqw;right:5.4167cqw;bottom:2.3958cqw;display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;padding-top:1.3542cqw;border-top:0.1042cqw solid rgba(195,154,56,0.45)\">\n    <div style=\"font-size:1.25cqw;letter-spacing:0.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C39A38;font-weight:600\">Lesson 05 · Light and Darkness</div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:1.5625cqw\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:1.25cqw;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C39A38\">Book p. 68</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:1.3542cqw;font-family:var(--deck-display),system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:800;color:#03194C\">06</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>"
