      "html": "<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:1.5625cqw\">\n    <div style=\"font-size:1.25cqw;letter-spacing:0.26em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#FAF7F0;font-weight:700;background:#03194C;padding:0.5729cqw 1.1458cqw\">Scripture</div>\n    <h2 style=\"margin:0;font-family:var(--deck-display),system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:3.4375cqw;line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-0.015em;color:#03194C\">Two Peoples, Two Conditions</h2>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"margin-top:2.2917cqw;background:#DEE0E2\">\n    <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:1.0417cqw;background:#C39A38;padding:0.6771cqw 1.5625cqw\">\n      <span style=\"font-family:var(--deck-display),system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:1.6667cqw;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#03194C\">1 Peter 2:9–10</span>\n      <span style=\"font-size:1.25cqw;letter-spacing:0.24em;color:#03194C;font-weight:700\">NIV</span>\n    </div>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;padding:1.7708cqw 2.0833cqw 1.9792cqw;font-family:var(--deck-serif),Georgia,serif;font-size:2.8125cqw;line-height:1.5;color:#1C1915;text-wrap:pretty\"><span style=\"color:#03194C;font-weight:700;font-size:1.6146cqw;vertical-align:0.3em\">9</span> But you are a chosen people, a royal priesthood, a holy nation, God’s special possession, that you may declare the praises of him who called you out of darkness into his wonderful light. <span style=\"color:#03194C;font-weight:700;font-size:1.6146cqw;vertical-align:0.3em\">10</span> Once you were not a people, but now you are the people of God; once you had not received mercy, but now you have received mercy.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"position:absolute;left:5cqw;right:5.4167cqw;bottom:2.3958cqw;display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;padding-top:1.3542cqw;border-top:0.1042cqw solid rgba(195,154,56,0.45)\">\n    <div style=\"font-size:1.25cqw;letter-spacing:0.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C39A38;font-weight:600\">Lesson 05 · Light and Darkness</div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:1.5625cqw\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:1.25cqw;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C39A38\">Book p. 69</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:1.3542cqw;font-family:var(--deck-display),system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:800;color:#03194C\">07</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>"
