      "label": "Romans 3:23 and 6:23",
      "screen": "11",
      "style": "background:#FAF7F0;color:#23201C;font-family:var(--deck-sans),system-ui,sans-serif;border-left:1.3542cqw solid #03194C;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:3.6458cqw 5.4167cqw 8.125cqw 5cqw",
      "html": "<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:1.5625cqw\">\n    <div style=\"font-size:1.25cqw;letter-spacing:0.26em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#FAF7F0;font-weight:700;background:#03194C;padding:0.5729cqw 1.1458cqw\">Scripture</div>\n    <h2 style=\"margin:0;font-family:var(--deck-display),system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:3.3333cqw;line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-0.015em;color:#03194C\">The Problem, and Its Price</h2>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;gap:2.2917cqw;margin-top:1.875cqw\">\n    <div style=\"flex:1;background:#DEE0E2\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:1.0417cqw;background:#C39A38;padding:0.6771cqw 1.5625cqw\">\n        <span style=\"font-family:var(--deck-display),system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:1.5104cqw;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#03194C\">Romans 3:23</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:1.25cqw;letter-spacing:0.24em;color:#03194C;font-weight:700\">NIV</span>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"margin:0;padding:1.7708cqw 2.0833cqw 1.9792cqw;font-family:var(--deck-serif),Georgia,serif;font-size:3.125cqw;line-height:1.46;color:#1C1915;text-wrap:pretty\"><span style=\"color:#03194C;font-weight:700;font-size:1.5625cqw;vertical-align:0.3em\">23</span> for all have sinned and fall short of the glory of God,</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"flex:1;background:#DEE0E2\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:1.0417cqw;background:#C39A38;padding:0.6771cqw 1.5625cqw\">\n        <span style=\"font-family:var(--deck-display),system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:1.5104cqw;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#03194C\">Romans 6:23</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:1.25cqw;letter-spacing:0.24em;color:#03194C;font-weight:700\">NIV</span>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"margin:0;padding:1.7708cqw 2.0833cqw 1.9792cqw;font-family:var(--deck-serif),Georgia,serif;font-size:3.125cqw;line-height:1.46;color:#1C1915;text-wrap:pretty\"><span style=\"color:#03194C;font-weight:700;font-size:1.5625cqw;vertical-align:0.3em\">23</span> For the wages of sin is death, but the gift of God is eternal life in Christ Jesus our Lord.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"margin-top:2.3958cqw\">\n    <div style=\"font-size:1.25cqw;letter-spacing:0.26em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C39A38;font-weight:600\">Understand</div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.25cqw;margin-top:1.4583cqw\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:1.3542cqw\"><div style=\"width:1.6667cqw;height:0.2083cqw;background:#C39A38;flex:none;margin-top:1.25cqw\"></div><div style=\"font-size:2.5cqw;line-height:1.34;max-width:72.9167cqw;text-wrap:pretty;font-weight:500\">For all have sinned, hence all people are condemned and in need of a savior.</div></div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:1.3542cqw\"><div style=\"width:1.6667cqw;height:0.2083cqw;background:#C39A38;flex:none;margin-top:1.25cqw\"></div><div style=\"font-size:2.5cqw;line-height:1.34;max-width:72.9167cqw;text-wrap:pretty;font-weight:500\">The penalty for sin is spiritual death, hence our spirit needs to be born again.</div></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"position:absolute;left:5cqw;right:5.4167cqw;bottom:2.3958cqw;display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;padding-top:1.3542cqw;border-top:0.1042cqw solid rgba(195,154,56,0.45)\">\n    <div style=\"font-size:1.25cqw;letter-spacing:0.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C39A38;font-weight:600\">Lesson 05 · Light and Darkness</div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:1.5625cqw\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:1.25cqw;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C39A38\">Book p. 71</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:1.3542cqw;font-family:var(--deck-display),system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:800;color:#03194C\">11</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>"
