      "html": "<div style=\"font-size:1.25cqw;letter-spacing:0.4em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C39A38;font-weight:600\">Key Truth</div>\n  <div style=\"height:0.2083cqw;background:#C39A38;width:8.3333cqw;margin:1.7708cqw 0 0\"></div>\n  <p style=\"margin:3.125cqw 0 0;font-family:var(--deck-display),system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:7.9167cqw;line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-0.035em;color:#FAF7F0;max-width:79.1667cqw;text-wrap:pretty\">The Church is not abandoned. The Church is awaited.</p>\n  <div style=\"position:absolute;left:7.8125cqw;right:7.8125cqw;bottom:2.6042cqw;display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between\">\n    <div style=\"font-size:1.25cqw;letter-spacing:0.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C39A38;font-weight:600\">Lesson 06 · Church</div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:1.5625cqw\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:1.25cqw;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C39A38\">Book p. 100</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:1.3542cqw;font-family:var(--deck-display),system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:800;color:#C39A38\">25</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>"
