      "html": "<div style=\"font-size:1.25cqw;letter-spacing:0.4em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6E520F;font-weight:700\">Prayer</div>\n  <div style=\"height:0.2083cqw;background:#C39A38;width:6.25cqw;margin:1.6667cqw 0 0\"></div>\n  <p style=\"margin:2.5cqw 0 0;font-family:var(--deck-serif),Georgia,serif;font-size:2.6042cqw;line-height:1.46;color:#1C1915;max-width:67.7083cqw;text-wrap:pretty\">Lord,<br><br>Thank You for Your Church. Teach me to value what You value.<br><br>Help me to love Your people, serve faithfully, protect unity, and remain true to Christ. Let my life strengthen Your body and honor You.<br><br>Amen.</p>\n  <div style=\"position:absolute;left:5cqw;right:5.4167cqw;bottom:2.6042cqw;display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between\">\n    <div style=\"font-size:1.25cqw;letter-spacing:0.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C39A38;font-weight:600\">Lesson 06 · Church</div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:1.5625cqw\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:1.25cqw;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C39A38\">Book p. 102</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:1.3542cqw;font-family:var(--deck-display),system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:800;color:#1E4A5E\">28</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>"
