      "html": "<div style=\"font-size:1.25cqw;letter-spacing:0.34em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8C6A16;font-weight:600\">Intro</div>\n  <h2 style=\"margin:1.4583cqw 0 0;font-family:var(--deck-display),system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:4.7917cqw;line-height:1.06;letter-spacing:-0.025em;color:#5E4415;max-width:78.125cqw;text-wrap:pretty\">The Cross is the foundation of Christianity.</h2>\n  <div style=\"height:0.2083cqw;background:#C39A38;width:6.875cqw;margin:1.7708cqw 0 0\"></div>\n  <p style=\"margin:1.7708cqw 0 0;font-size:2.9167cqw;line-height:1.28;max-width:81.25cqw;text-wrap:pretty;font-weight:500\">Sin hurts both God and us. Jesus was fully God and fully human, and He experienced real sorrow, struggle, pain, rejection, and suffering.</p>\n  <p style=\"margin:1.9792cqw 0 0;font-size:3.5417cqw;line-height:1.2;font-weight:600;color:#5E4415;max-width:78.125cqw;text-wrap:pretty\">How do you truly view the Cross?</p>\n  <div style=\"position:absolute;left:5cqw;right:5.4167cqw;bottom:2.3958cqw;display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;padding-top:1.3542cqw;border-top:0.1042cqw solid rgba(195,154,56,0.45)\">\n    <div style=\"font-size:1.25cqw;letter-spacing:0.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8C6A16;font-weight:600\">Lesson 07 · Cross</div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:1.5625cqw\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:1.25cqw;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8C6A16\">Book p. 105</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:1.3542cqw;font-family:var(--deck-display),system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:800;color:#5E4415\">04</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>"
