      "html": "<div style=\"font-size:1.25cqw;letter-spacing:0.4em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#E0BC6A;font-weight:600\">Acts 2:42 · NIV</div>\n  <div style=\"height:0.2083cqw;background:#C39A38;width:10.4167cqw;margin:1.7708cqw 0 0\"></div>\n  <p style=\"margin:2.7083cqw 0 0;font-family:var(--deck-serif),Georgia,serif;font-size:3.3333cqw;line-height:1.36;color:#FAF7F0;max-width:80.2083cqw;text-wrap:pretty\"><span style=\"color:#E0BC6A;font-weight:600;font-size:2.2917cqw;vertical-align:0.3em\">42</span> They devoted themselves to the apostlesʼ teaching and to fellowship, to the breaking of bread and to prayer.</p>\n  <div style=\"margin-top:4.1667cqw;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.625cqw\">\n    <div style=\"font-family:var(--deck-display),system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:2.2917cqw;letter-spacing:0.02em;color:#FAF7F0\">Acts 242 Church of Christ</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:1.7708cqw;line-height:1.4;color:#EBDFC4;font-weight:500\">4707 Dr Arcadio Santos Ave, Parañaque, 1700 Metro Manila</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:1.7708cqw;line-height:1.4\"><a href=\"https://www.acts242churchofchrist.com\">acts242churchofchrist.com</a></div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"position:absolute;left:7.8125cqw;right:7.8125cqw;bottom:2.6042cqw;display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;font-size:1.25cqw;letter-spacing:0.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#E0BC6A\">\n    <div>Acts 242 Foundation Guide · Edition 1 · 2026</div>\n    <div>End of the Seven Lessons</div>\n  </div>"
